sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports local cost calculation by CS
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.Enabled[Tariff] = true
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.MaxElements[Tariff] > 0
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.ConditionsSupported[Tariff] = true

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to set a default tariff on EVSE 0 with<br>- validFrom<br>- Price for energy in peak hours<br>- Price for energy other hours

    CSMS->>CS: SetDefaultTariffRequest (evseId = 0, tariff)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId 0<br>tariff.validFrom must be not omitted<br>tariff.energy.prices[0].priceKwh must be not omitted<br>tariff.energy.prices[0].conditions.startTimeOfDay must be in RFC 3339 format time-hour ":" time-minute<br>tariff.energy.prices[0].conditions.endTimeOfDay must be in RFC 3339 format time-hour ":" time-minute<br>tariff.energy.prices[1].priceKwh must be not omitted<br>tariff.energy.prices[1].conditions.startTimeOfDay must be in RFC 3339 format time-hour ":" time-minute<br>tariff.energy.prices[1].conditions.endTimeOfDay must be in RFC 3339 format time-hour ":" time-minute

    CS-->>CSMS: SetDefaultTariffResponse (status = TooManyElements)
